{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0c13d24be1a1a669b6e20657aa86faea8e9ae9c7747d1d8aeff481a48c785435"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project provides CLI tools, skills, agents, hooks, and plugins intended to enhance productivity with Claude Code and other coding agents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b802df94b0c4cefbe1da936282e938a2d1622ddd86d66c18a32d62a722e46786"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"README badges link the package to PyPI as claude-code-tools and to a Rust crate named aichat-search on crates.io."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0c13d24be1a1a669b6e20657aa86faea8e9ae9c7747d1d8aeff481a48c785435","clm_b802df94b0c4cefbe1da936282e938a2d1622ddd86d66c18a32d62a722e46786"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f029701ca5a4e8ab6cbb19dd506cbec","id":"pg_236b0e35f92b53b0a010d9b13fb5a9c6","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/pchalasani-claude-code-tools-readme-md-ee0f3099c05c-d9b13fb5a9c6.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6b1aba66b13b59b994e6a4a1614a47e2"],"title":"pchalasani/claude-code-tools/README.md @ ee0f3099c05c","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f029701ca5a4e8ab6cbb19dd506cbec"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f029701ca5a4e8ab6cbb19dd506cbec","id":"pg_2ae63478ed2c5ad28fd6cce276fb6443","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/pchalasani-claude-code-tools-docs-claude-code-tmux-tutorials-md-ee0f30-cce276fb6443.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6172905d313e544b9281c54ec2cb6335"],"title":"pchalasani/claude-code-tools/docs/claude-code-tmux-tutorials.md @ ee0f3099c05c","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f029701ca5a4e8ab6cbb19dd506cbec"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f029701ca5a4e8ab6cbb19dd506cbec","id":"pg_3431ec8fdcbd54f2b1f472494f6a9c96","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/pchalasani-claude-code-tools-proposal-exit-code-extraction-md-ee0f3099-72494f6a9c96.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_0b6819445adc519c8d60eb1197c75197"],"title":"pchalasani/claude-code-tools/PROPOSAL-exit-code-extraction.md @ ee0f3099c05c","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:15:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f029701ca5a4e8ab6cbb19dd506cbec"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1298c9ef91d5d6a6528a1bc0dba091a7b5c8f7585a7cf7bc864dd19b9e9c3a0a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The >share hook (hooks/share_hook.py) is a standalone stdlib UserPromptSubmit hook that reads session_id/cwd/transcript_path from stdin, writes an fcntl-locked atomic registry, and blocks the prompt to print the handle."},{"claim_ids":["clm_26415cee010dbd178c9aed47a3f9bdf242cbc1dc0c83f79206572dc9adfd382f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"In a watched channel, '<handle> [question]' opens a Discord thread bound to that session with follow-ups staying in the thread; !list/!handles list active handles; !done/!close/!end tear down the fork immediately."},{"claim_ids":["clm_27202477a165f912b1e66bb9379a7f51e62d22ab118c365c9e88e760be7c5f7a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"agent-tunnel exposes long-lived local Claude Code sessions ('experts') to teammates over Discord; a session is published at runtime with >share and addressed by a short handle, with each conversation answered against a read-only fork."},{"claim_ids":["clm_40dfded60246ce70ea24eed84e923f6c75228ab9106bb42aca29977378d07c20"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The spec notes a ToS gray area: consumer plans prohibit making your account available to others, and headless with an API key is described as the unambiguous path."},{"claim_ids":["clm_53b690b8c997afefeb80c402807cd315948bf5e822d89fdbc86be2c518184484"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"agent-tunnel supports two backends: headless (default) runs claude -p per question with clean JSON I/O, while tmux runs an interactive claude per thread in a private tmux server window, watchable via agent-tunnel watch."},{"claim_ids":["clm_56f7787c1dcb25553bcdf1dbe3b58d0caaebd513078f45089da8ab348e1e9fda"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Security model: read-only tools are hard-enforced by the CLI permission layer by default; access is Discord channel membership plus optional user/role allowlists, and the persona's discouragement of leaking secrets is described as a soft layer only."},{"claim_ids":["clm_672792543a29b3a6dc03c2bac185826b610c4c791a586907f87e34a8ca5eb465"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Write/bash forks save deliverables to .agent-tunnel-out/<thread>/; the bot snapshots and diffs that dir to post new or modified files as Discord attachments, and a wildcard .gitignore keeps deliverables out of git status."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6734c7ab7fedbd3bc28dc4b08fed6159d4e47ecb4b0c4cca5438973325155295"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"agent-tunnel uses no inbound tunnel: it connects via the Discord Gateway's outbound websocket, so nothing on the machine is internet-reachable."},{"claim_ids":["clm_680c1219b2532e636a8881cbd2bc6fa99fdc7d8f3979fdab7f549f4eadcb6028"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per-handle access levels: --write adds Write/Edit/NotebookEdit (never Bash); --dangerously-allow-bash adds command execution; --dangerously-skip-permissions lets the fork use any tool or MCP server the session has."},{"claim_ids":["clm_72d4a6321fc48c7c7b9efdf8c179b674385bf8e53d666b1887fd9ad4b44dacb8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the agent-tunnel spec reports unit tests using real files without mocks, covering the registry, hook, store, session discovery, flag building, config, and attachment handling."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8e547980325ffe280d0dbc15b900bee6c6c1a316fe50316f3e5eeef9fc5e50e2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Binary Office attachments are best-effort converted using whatever converter is on PATH (LibreOffice→PDF preferred, else pandoc→Markdown, else macOS textutil); no converter is a hard dependency, and PDF/images/text work unaided."},{"claim_ids":["clm_adc7f9e1fbae4d3131568fe08021103e58bf45cd72c7ee4b5bdb90cd9e9a1f14"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Inbound attachments are downloaded to a per-thread uploads dir outside any repo and exposed to the fork via --add-dir, with per-file size and count caps; oversized or excess files are skipped with a notice."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d61005b097b552348cadf1a37cd77e02c5481b6b7472afb4fa44fbfacee8ab1c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The config dir is propagated end to end: the hook derives it from transcript_path and records it in the registry, and the daemon pins each fork via CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR so work and personal sessions fork under their own config/account."},{"claim_ids":["clm_de6afbb8995390a98cd9d4a17336cfa38dfb53e55f7edaf03fc074e6095cfb08"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The spec reports live end-to-end validation of agent-tunnel in both headless mode and tmux-over-Discord, confirming forked sessions inherit context and follow-ups continue the same fork."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f451ca94e7446318f904cc67fdc9875255560ea910e631fde566a473d91c2b0d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Threads answer via --resume with --fork-session so the original session is untouched; remote turns run with --allowedTools Read,Grep,Glob, an explicit deny list, and --permission-mode dontAsk."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1298c9ef91d5d6a6528a1bc0dba091a7b5c8f7585a7cf7bc864dd19b9e9c3a0a","clm_26415cee010dbd178c9aed47a3f9bdf242cbc1dc0c83f79206572dc9adfd382f","clm_27202477a165f912b1e66bb9379a7f51e62d22ab118c365c9e88e760be7c5f7a","clm_40dfded60246ce70ea24eed84e923f6c75228ab9106bb42aca29977378d07c20","clm_53b690b8c997afefeb80c402807cd315948bf5e822d89fdbc86be2c518184484","clm_56f7787c1dcb25553bcdf1dbe3b58d0caaebd513078f45089da8ab348e1e9fda","clm_672792543a29b3a6dc03c2bac185826b610c4c791a586907f87e34a8ca5eb465","clm_6734c7ab7fedbd3bc28dc4b08fed6159d4e47ecb4b0c4cca5438973325155295","clm_680c1219b2532e636a8881cbd2bc6fa99fdc7d8f3979fdab7f549f4eadcb6028","clm_72d4a6321fc48c7c7b9efdf8c179b674385bf8e53d666b1887fd9ad4b44dacb8","clm_8e547980325ffe280d0dbc15b900bee6c6c1a316fe50316f3e5eeef9fc5e50e2","clm_adc7f9e1fbae4d3131568fe08021103e58bf45cd72c7ee4b5bdb90cd9e9a1f14","clm_d61005b097b552348cadf1a37cd77e02c5481b6b7472afb4fa44fbfacee8ab1c","clm_de6afbb8995390a98cd9d4a17336cfa38dfb53e55f7edaf03fc074e6095cfb08","clm